    "title": "AHS baseball comes out swinging - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Steve Berentson ,\n11 hours ago Batter up! It’s a new season for AHS baseball, and the team has come out swinging. An 8-0 win Saturday and a 9-0 win Tuesday against the Bellingham Bayhawks. As the scores indicate, the Hawks are stepping to the plate with purpose … and with results. Pitchers for the Seahawks include Aiden Lefave and Wes Green. Head coach this year is Ty Saunders. Photos are from Tuesday’s game. Go Hawks! Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
